50,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"The candidates are A, B, C, and D. Given the reviews, B or D seem most likely to be well-received.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"B addresses the general room shortage directly. D is specialist, which my data suggests is less urgent.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,George,,"A would solve the technicians' manual routine issues, though Benjamin mentioned the rising cost of mechanical plant.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"C is too risky with the weather and delivery history. A or B are safer, provided A's costs are managed.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A is a financial risk. B uses an underused hall, which is efficient, but D's AV needs are unfunded.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"I lean toward B. It's a general-use space, which historically rates the highest in post-occupancy reviews.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Victoria,,I strongly support B. It solves the booking crisis and avoids the off-site hiring costs of more invasive work.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,George,,"I am torn, but the technicians' struggle makes A compelling. However, B is a more stable choice for the campus.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"B is the most logical. It's indoors, avoiding weather delays, and doesn't fall into the ""comfort"" trap of slipping schedules.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,B is the most fiscally prudent. It avoids the inflation of mechanical tenders and the lack of AV reserves.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Toshio,,It seems we have a consensus forming around the Central Study Commons.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree. It is the most rational choice.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,George,,I will concede to the group. B it is.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,A rare moment of total agreement. I'm in favor of B.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
